                <invention-title lang="de">VERFAHREN UND VORRICHTUNGEN ZUR BERECHTIGUNGSFREIEN DATENÜBERTRAGUNG IN EINEM DRAHTLOSKOMMUNIKATIONSSYSTEM</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">PROCÉDÉS ET APPAREILS DE TRANSMISSION DE DONNÉES SANS AUTORISATION DANS UN SYSTÈME DE COMMUNICATION SANS FIL</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">METHODS AND APPARATUSES FOR GRANT-FREE DATA TRANSMISSION IN WIRELESS COMMUNICATION SYSTEM</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A terminal and a method performed by the terminal in a communication system are provided, the method including:receiving, from a base station, a semi-persistent scheduling, SPS, configuration; andidentifying an SPS physical downlink shared channel, PDSCH, in a slot based on the SPS configuration; andreceiving, from the base station, downlink control information, DCI, for SPS PDSCH release in the slot,wherein hybrid automatic repeat request, HARQ,-acknowledge, ACK, information for the SPS PDSCH release and HARQ ACK information for the SPS PDSCH are mapped to a same physical uplink control channel, PUCCH.</p>
            </abstract>
